  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engagement Facility - Rights Now: Driving the right to a clean, healthy and sustainable environment through strengthened environmental governance in Malaysia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance relationship between duty-bearers and rightsholders by aligning frameworks with international environmental rights standards, supporting implementation of Malaysias NAPBHR 2025-2030, enabling meaningful participation of women, youth and Indigenous communities in decision-making, and mobilising public awareness and action on environmental rights.</narrative>
  </description>
